  "_comment": "The page's machinery, its HTML compared too (compareSource: the document as the browser holds it, a tag a line; the view state, event validation and resource keys masked). Lifecycle: the order of events of the page, its master, a user control and custom controls (a WebControl of its own tag, a composite, one with post data, postback events and control state, a templated data-bound one), changed events and clicks on a postback, a control added in Load (it catches up) and one added in PreRender (its click is lost). ClientIds: ClientIDMode in every form and the IDs labels, validators and the summary use. Scripts: every ClientScriptManager registration, a manual postback, a client callback, the default button and focus, a confirm. State: ViewStateMode and positional view state of dynamic controls swapped. Expressions: builders, global resources, inline code, page data binding, XPath. Cookies: values set and read back by the server and the script. Browser: Request.Browser and the request. Output: a response filter, writing before the page, plain text, Clear, Flush, the head made in code. web.config: controlRenderingCompatibilityVersion 4.0.",
